# TABLE_WIDTH USED TO SIT HERE, AND IT DIED WITH THE TREEVIEW THAT READ IT.
# <agent> 2026-08-21: after the storefront conversion nothing in the
# product read it, and the only survivors were three contracts and one sabotage
